<view class="page">
  <view class="home-header"><view class="title">库存盘点</view><view class="subtitle">拿出家里的药，逐批次核对实际余量，让药箱记录与实物一致。</view></view>
  <view class="card guide-card">
    <view class="section-title">怎样盘点？</view>
    <view class="guide-step">① 看药品与包装　② 数实际余量　③ 选择结果并保存</view>
    <view class="hint">数量没变化：确认现有记录。修改余量：按实物更新数量。已用完／已处理：将该批次余量记为 0。</view>
    <view class="hint">暂不核对：跳过本次核对，保留原来的余量；未知数量仍是未知，绝不会自动记为 0。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{loading}}"><view class="hint">正在读取盘点…</view></view>
  <view class="card error-card" wx:if="{{errorMessage}}"><view class="hint">{{errorMessage}}</view><view class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="refresh">重新读取</view></view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{!loading && !stocktake}}">
    <view class="section-title">开始一次盘点</view><view class="hint">每批次单独确认，不会把一个批次的结果套到其他包装。</view>
    <view class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="onStart">{{submitting ? "正在开始…" : "开始盘点"}}</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{stocktake}}">
    <view class="card session-card"><view class="section-title">本次盘点</view><view class="hint">开始时间：{{stocktake.startedAt}}</view></view>
    <view class="card stocktake-item" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="batchId" wx:for-item="item" wx:for-index="index">
      <view class="medicine-name">{{item.medicineName}}</view>
      <view class="hint">当前记录：{{item.quantity === null ? '数量未知' : item.quantity + item.unit}} · 按本批次核对</view>
      <view class="result-warning" wx:if="{{item.resultLabel}}">{{item.resultLabel}}</view>
      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-label">核对结果</view>
        <picker range="{{outcomeLabels}}" value="{{item.outcomeIndex}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="onOutcomeChange">
          <view class="picker-box">{{outcomeLabels[item.outcomeIndex]}}</view>
        </picker>
      </view>
      <view class="field" wx:if="{{item.outcome === 'adjusted'}}">
        <view class="field-label">实际余量</view><input class="input" type="digit" data-index="{{index}}" value="{{item.adjustedQuantity}}" bindinput="onQuantityInput" placeholder="{{item.unit === 'ml' ? '可填写小数，如 12.5' : '不小于 0 的整数'}}" />
      </view>
      <view class="outcome-note">{{item.outcome === 'deferred' ? '本批次暂不核对，原记录不会变化。' : item.outcome === 'unchanged' ? '已核对实物，余量与原记录一致。' : item.outcome === 'adjusted' ? '保存后以填写的实际余量更新记录。' : '保存后该批次余量记为 0。'}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="onSubmit">{{submitting ? "保存中…" : "保存并完成盘点"}}</view>
  </view>
</view>
